# PROJECT TITLE

**QuizGenius AI — Generative AI for Automatic Quiz Generation from Study Material with Quality Evaluation Using LLMs and Transformer Models**

## 1. ROLE AND OBJECTIVE

Act as a senior full-stack developer, AI/ML engineer, UI/UX designer, database architect, cybersecurity engineer, and animation specialist.

Build a complete, production-style, premium web application called **QuizGenius AI**.

The platform uses Generative AI, Large Language Models (LLMs), Natural Language Processing (NLP), and Transformer-based models to generate educational quizzes automatically from uploaded study materials.

The platform must provide a beautiful user interface, sophisticated animations, secure authentication, personalized dashboards, interactive quizzes, AI-based quality evaluation, performance analytics, and a complete user account system.

Do not create just a landing page or static UI prototype. Build a functional application with a working frontend, backend, database, authentication system, AI integration, and all major features.

Make the application visually impressive, intuitive, responsive, accessible, and suitable for a final-year academic project or a startup-style product demonstration.

